{"completed": true, "response": "{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有，X在S08-S12这类20多秒的短段里仍要在“话”和多条感受之间切换，单看主线时不如Y只盯左栏省力。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X把每一步心理变化拆成短句，并用加亮字先给落点，感受又贴在对应转折旁、部分到音乐走到那里才出现，所以扫过去更容易同时抓住“发生什么—为什么会变—此刻是什么质感”。Y的左栏主线其实清楚，但右栏常一次堆很多并列词，尤其S03、S06、S08等段会让我在几秒内不知道哪些最重要、哪些对应哪一句，细腻感反而容易变成素材堆积；X从“不服气—想念—害怕孤单—不愿因害怕回头—带着想念往前”也更像同一条连续的心理线。\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c951bb27-ad26-4b99-8676-237399eb0fb6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T032146619151Z", "elapsed_seconds": 8.391, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:21:55.025854+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8da7be352498874e90baec2bedd87155b560cfd9e672f3f7c64a572417d5674d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f458289